# Post-change Prettier formatting

After implementing any code change, format every modified code or configuration file with Prettier before final verification.

- Use the repository's configured Prettier command or `pnpm exec prettier --write <changed-files>`.
- Do not claim completion until Prettier has run successfully on the changed files.
- Then run the applicable lint, build, and quality gates.
